From 67f472a24d96aace23347f3a164a2cb6a5569db3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kayori <thatzokay@proton.me>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 23:39:44 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 30/30] grate: format the lines added since the fork to the
 Mesa style

Wrap the lines added by the earlier grate patches to 78 columns, with the
indentation, brace and return-type layout of src/.clang-format (which
disables formatting by default; this used a copy with DisableFormat: false
and ColumnLimit: 78, include sorting off). Only lines changed since
4830fcbcc57 were formatted, so the fork's own code is untouched, and drm/
is left alone because it follows its libdrm origin (4-space).

No functional change: the regression, blend, ladder and dual-source tests
give the same results before and after.
